cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these scripts or data, please cite the article they accompany
  (see "preferred-citation") and this archive.
title: "kairotops-article: scripts and data of the article 'Kairotops as opportune designs of disordered materials'"
abstract: >-
  Scripts reproducing the numerical studies of the article (stiffness benchmark across solid fractions,
  morphological control, anisotropic objectives, robustness to defects, detailed optimization example,
  printed-beam analysis, initialization length and density filter radius), with the microstructures of
  the stiffness benchmark (S1). Generation and homogenization rely on Kairotop.jl v0.2.0.
